Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Powerful families within the kingdom's\Nbounds rose to prominence over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They became today's royals and nobles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taxing commoners in their\Nbid to maintain peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the rise of magic blurred divisions\Nof power, threatening the status quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because King LaSalle\Nbelieves in meritocracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he began admitting commoners to\Nthe Royal Academy on scholarship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone would be treated\Nequally, or so he thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.60,0:00:42.89,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.19,0:00:45.86,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.02,0:00:48.82,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.11,0:00:52.00,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.96,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call you fly yard.
