Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to lose.
