Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei Zhang Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More once!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.80,0:02:00.43,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei Zhang Han!
