Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner movement he\Nshouldn't have assaulted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him with magic I don't\Nknow exactly what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but No one deserves that\Nmost likely the commoner
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said something offensive\Nto provoke the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their little faction it's called the\Ncommoner movement isn't it they were spewing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nonsense About nobles\Nand commoners being equal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,foolish claims with no\Nbasis in reality and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look what They led to it's no wonder they\Nsay the tongue is the whip of evil you say
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that but what would You think if a noble
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spoke out and got hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a noble hypothetically
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course but not hypothetically You can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whip me evilly anytime this is the only
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reality she knows guess\NI can't blame her for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not getting it? Um... Pardon me.\NWe've completed his treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hello
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again Matt right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taylor I hate To do\Nthis to you while you're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,recovering but the\NAcademy Knights have some
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,questions I'm sure you\NYou must be in pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do you think you could answer a few?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows the knights are\Nthose disgusting nobles lapdogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I have absolutely\Nnothing to say to a commoner
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who pledges her loyalty\Nto the likes of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The knights are here to\Nprotect all students.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, well, cooperating would be wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're commoners just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know how hard it is to redeem\Nyourself after crossing a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it a risk for us\Nto voice our opinions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why we need to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to relax, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to get your side of the story\Nand make sure you're treated fairly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, Matt, just tell me\Nwhat happened out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It started when me and some\Nothers approached Prince Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He honestly listened\Nto what we had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then that jerk found out about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, commoner,\Nstay away from Prince Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was livid, and I couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told them what I really thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said that royals and nobles were\Nnothing but tax-leeching parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just stay calm, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important that we\Nhear what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand him speaking out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, without even thinking, I took\Nout my wand to defend your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent mongrel, you shut your\Nmouth or I'll shut it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the next thing I knew,\NI was waking up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do these nobles think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them burned me alive because I took\Na stand on something he disagreed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to scare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no intention of using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear in the name of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His wand, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already been confiscated\Nand sent off for analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll also be inspecting it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That innocent boy could\Nhave been any one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't stand for this oppression!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight for equality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We demand justice for our\Nbrother and safety for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word travels fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even people who don't go to\Nschool here are up in arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you mind explaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us what you were doing with\Nthis matt guy in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wanted to speak to me\Nabout His group's objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked me to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which was only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never agreed to support their Cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you did or not, that\Nwas a pretty careless move. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to consider your\NPosition in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before god, all are equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we are taught a tenant\Nof the spiritual church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume the church opens its\Ndoors to anyone who knocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have been wrong of me to turn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that boy away without hearing him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the subject of the\Nchurch, let's talk about the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lineage of the Bauer family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Rod and Prince Thane are the\Nsons of a princess from the land of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was the former queen\Nand died at a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Yu's mother, Grishe,\Nis the current queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before she married the king, she was\Na cardinal of the spiritual church,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hence her son's scripture reciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The church is the dominant religion here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it centers around\Ndevotion to the spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kingdom hoped that the marriage\Nwould give it power over the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the church grew even more powerful thanks\Nto its connection to the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Yu is often seen as a symbol of\Nthe church's authority over the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The teachings of the church tend to align\Nmost with the commoner movement's beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've even heard rumors floating around\Nthat the church is financing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is Matt and his friends approached\NPrince Yu in hopes of requesting aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that meeting\Nwith them was irresponsible,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Deed would never\Nhurt anyone on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd stake my life on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently Deed's defense is\Nthat he lost control of his wand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the magic discharged on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were any defects found in the wand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I personally examined it\Nwhile keeping that in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I saw no signs that\Nit had malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone who knows magic tools as\Nwell as you says so, it must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, whatever occurs outside\Nthe academy is beyond our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stay focused on what we can\Ndo until Deed's fate is determined!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us can chat\Nwith the noble students.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully something will get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey and Misha, you handle the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to their grievances\Nand try to calm things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem too pleased\Nto have been given that task.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suck at talking to people\Nabout serious stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although a head pat from you\Nmight make me feel better. A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to do my best try?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you add a pinch of\Nlove, like a tiny peach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:08:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! That's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to work, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a campus to quiet\Ndown, and not much time to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.17,Signs_Nameplates,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,820)\fn07LightNovelPOP\fsp1\bord4\c&HFFFFFB&\3c&HFFFFFB&\blur0.5\fad(474,1)}One Week Later
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.17,Signs_Nameplates,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,820)\fn07LightNovelPOP\fsp1\c&H000000&\blur0.6\fad(474,1)}One Week Later
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's too crowded in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sentence is about to be posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all want to know what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dean Murray is sentenced to be\Nunder house arrest for one week?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've lost their minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A week of house arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He almost killed someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of justice is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody shouldn't be here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone has to calm this chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your meritocracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't everyone supposed to\Nbe equal at the Academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed and nothing ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nobles will always come out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Entry into the Academy is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Academy will be on temporary lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the military will join our\Nguards until the protests end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not stay quiet about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy can't stand up to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, his attacker's\Npunishment is to stay at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, everyone here\Nfeels the same way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it appears that some nobles\Nwho disagree with the commoner
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,movement sought a reduced sentence\Nand got what they requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd been\Nawfully quiet lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We let this happen right\Nunder our noses. There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out the church is giving\Nits support to the nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The church has been financing the\Ncommoner movement, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a political move, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may claim that they never get involved\Nin politics, but that's obviously a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power struggles as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want to take public\Nsupport from the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They help both commoners and\Nnobles in order to heighten the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tension between them and weaken\Nthe authority of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Queen Rishay know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not privy to my mother's\Nthoughts on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you just go talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I requested a meeting, but she refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's her right as queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but she's your\Nmother first, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:11:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being her son does not\Ngive me any power in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is what\Nthe church is truly after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they're trying to create\Na rift between the princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having us at odds would\Nundermine royal authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you may be onto something, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the military will be\Nprotecting us from outside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's our job as knights to protect\Nthe school grounds from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:13:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you make it back to your room, I need\Nyou to stay there until tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you ask something like that\Nwith everything that's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Academy Knight's job to be\Non call at a time like this, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you won't do as I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just put her to sleep with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please, escort her to the\Ndorm and hide there until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise you won't leave the\Nroom no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the protesters will\Nbreak down the school gate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you know something, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on Lene,\Nyou love Miss Claire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you ever doubt that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been in her service for\Nmuch longer than you have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, then I'll leave her to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trusting you to do the right thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The soldiers just went down, not sure\Nwhat happened, but this is our chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The protestors have reached the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cooperate with the military\Nand try to quiet the mob!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must protect the\Nacademy no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That noble is gonna get\Nwhat's coming to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an order from your future king!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not take a single step closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're wasting time—I\Ndestroyed that bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of yours now you have no\Nway to control monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a clever invention but you'll\Nnever get to use it Master Lambert
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Ray Taylor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping you before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you might be confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told about the riot and came here\Nto protect these priceless magic tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can drop the act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Deed's wand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His wand was fine. I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everyone believed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're a magic tool specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your job to inspect\Nand maintain all the tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it'd be pretty easy for\Nyou to rig Deed's wand to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discharge on its own and to\Neliminate evidence of tampering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Child's play, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't just that incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been encouraging animosity between\Nnobles and commoners this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the rioters overran the school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were planning to ring that\Nbell and make monsters attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a fascinating hypothesis,\Nbut do you have evidence to back it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, none at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But proof or not, I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, I know the commoner\Nmovement means nothing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's assume what you're\Nsaying is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of motive would\NI have to do any of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kingdom relies on\Nthe Oruso Company for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the mining and distribution\Nof magic stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they've accumulated\Nmassive wealth from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they were to dismantle the\Nsystem that gave them their riches,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd be left with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason\Nhe'd take such a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're using Lene as\Na hostage, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's more than just your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's someone you love very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Taylor, tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that some would say\Nhomosexuality is the forbidden love,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but here you are with Lene and she's\Nyour blood sibling and you - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stop! Lene, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise you won't get in my brother's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt\NMiss Claire, but I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real shame, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Lambert, please stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you I'll do\Nsomething to help Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Lambert!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know how terrifying he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I fail, you'll kill Lene\Nwithout a moment's hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it, Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't sleep in peace, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I don't know the full story here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but tell me, is it accurate to say\Nthat you two are behind all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender now while you have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you were planning to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that won't do it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on right now,\Nit isn't a plotline in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recognize any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Lambert, be a good\Nboy and call the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bell is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you hold up\Nyour end of the bargain,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you escape the\Ncountry as I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you and your sister can live\Na new life with new identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two could finally have the\Nlife you've always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lambert, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want that freedom, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would it be like not to\Nhide your love any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.44,0:19:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a chimera?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimera!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I command you to eliminate the nobles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go find the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreating may mean more casualties and\Nharsher punishment for Linnaeus and Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to hold it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Linnaeus is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Responsibility, let's call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a tsundere!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is a\Ntsundere and why am I one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at a disadvantage here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just blatantly ignored me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she sticks to landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sub-Zero, freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those magic skills of yours\Nare completely ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no magic too\Nridiculous for a lady in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It possesses multiple attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:22:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A head of fire, a body of\Nearth, and a tail of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it'll break\Nout of the ice pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means, Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are about to undertake\Nour first Herculean labor of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haha!
