Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.71,0:23:12.94,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I'm head over heels for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.94,0:23:15.15,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}And I'd rather just be honest:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.15,0:23:16.82,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I can't help but love you -
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.82,0:23:17.99,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}And I'm not embarrassed at all!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.99,0:23:21.04,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I don't want to be hurt,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.04,0:23:22.12,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If we can't be together,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.12,0:23:25.61,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Then there's only one thing I want to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.63,0:23:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a bad thing, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.81,0:23:31.77,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when I see my soul,\NI won't be able to meet.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.77,0:23:35.74,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Someone who I could never meet in my world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.74,0:23:39.74,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}As we grow close to each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.70,0:23:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see how it will be.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.74,0:23:44.66,ed_eng_08_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}My feelings keep growing stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, as long as I have you,\Nnothing can scare me. Good.
